<title>SPAIN: Spain's 6-month bill yield is 6.825 percent.</title>
<headline>Spain's 6-month bill yield is 6.825 percent.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Spain announced the following results at today's Treasury debt auction (amounts bid, allocated in billions of pesetas):</p>
<p>ISSUE	Yield    Pvs     Price     Pvs	Bid    Allocated</p>
<p>6-month    6.825    n/a     96.70     n/a    917.263   187.248</p>
<p>NOTE- Price comparisons are not provided because the Treasury's last 6-month bill issue took place in August 1995.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 8315</p>
</text>
